# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
build
release
*.local

# Rust / Tauri build output
src-tauri/target
src-tauri/gen

# Large prebuilt binary assets — the STT model exceeds GitHub's 100MB
# per-file limit, and none of these belong in git history anyway (they're
# large, binary, and unchanged build inputs, not source). See README.md's
# "Getting the model and sidecar binaries" section for how to obtain them.
models/
sidecars/

# Secrets — never commit real values. .env.example (placeholders only) is
# tracked deliberately.
.env

# Machine-specific local cargo overrides (e.g. custom target-dir)
.cargo/
.env.*
!.env.example

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
